# Overview
This project is a website for St. Athanasius Orthdodox Church. The website's goal is to provide visitors and parishoners with information about the parish.

# Tech Stack
- Next.js 15 with App Router
- shadcn/ui component library
- Tailwindcss v4 for styling. 
- Kysely for database access. See [types.d.ts](mdc:db/types.d.ts) for database schema generated types.


